From 498b27f10f60bd1c36284cebaafe2365adfbdfe3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew <matthewhale@live.com.au>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 06:30:38 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 43/59] XvT control sounds, silent Z, Shift+' all laser energy
 to shields

audio.xvt_control_sounds: F9/F10 play XvT's per-setting tones, energy transfers its
confirm beep (small click when nothing moves), and the 0, 1/3 and 2/3 throttle keys
its small click. The Z threat display no longer plays a sound. New action
xfer_all_cannon_to_shields (key 240, Shift+') ports XvT's FLIGHT_KEY_QUOTES.
